+/// P6 (TV-W6): whether the support code's ticket says the staff member's connection will carry
+/// the mark: not when the core's pc-code result says `"staff": false` (the PC kept no support
+/// grant), so that the toast then promises nothing (P2's words). A result without the field (a
+/// core before it) keeps P6 as it was; the mark itself never shows without the grant.
+bool hjvCodeTicketStaff(String result) {
+  try {
+    final value = jsonDecode(result);
+    if (value is Map && value['staff'] == false) return false;
+  } catch (e) {
+    // no result
+  }
+  return true;
+}
